      ],
      "text": "Prerequisites are Node.js 20+, tmux, and ripgrep (auto-installed by the installer script per the README), plus at least one supported AI CLI such as Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Aider, or Cursor CLI."
    },
    {
