        "slc_e008659355c98b7693f037b636062372ea66869d4648c98f0e86c17a5eb8aa33"
      ],
      "text": "The product supports multiple AI coding agents with a capability matrix: only Claude Code and Kilo Code support resume and fork, and each agent has a distinct auto-approve mechanism (flags or config files)."
    },
